[2026-03-14T21:17:27.314Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PXe1kgiB6QnYdYr74jyDNJ","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me create a comprehensive summary report:\n\n## LinearClone App Comprehensive Exploration Report\n\nI've conducted a thorough exploration of the LinearClone app located at `/repo/apps/LinearClone/`. Here's a detailed breakdown:\n\n---\n\n### 1. APP DIRECTORY STRUCTURE\n\n**Main directories:**\n- `/src` - Frontend React application (71 TypeScript/TSX files)\n- `/netlify/functions` - Backend API endpoints (26 functions)\n- `/scripts` - Database schema, seeding, and utility scripts\n- `/tests` - Playwright test files (6 test specs)\n- `/docs` - Documentation including tests.md (2685 lines)\n- `/public` - Static assets\n- `netlify.toml` - Netlify configuration\n- `playwright.config.ts` - Playwright test configuration\n- `vite.config.ts` - Vite bundler configuration\n- `tsconfig.*.json` - TypeScript configurations\n\n**Key dependencies:**\n- React 19.2.0, React Router 7.6.1\n- Redux Toolkit 2.11.2, React-Redux 9.2.0\n- Neon Database (serverless PostgreSQL)\n- Netlify Functions for API\n- Playwright for E2E testing with Replay.io integration\n\n---\n\n### 2. DATABASE SCHEMA & SEED DATA\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/`\n\n**Schema file:** `schema.ts`\n- Defines 12 main tables with proper relationships and indexes\n\n**Tables:**\n- `workspaces` - Top-level container, one per app\n- `members` - Users with bcrypt password hashing (pbkdf2)\n- `sessions` - JWT-like token-based sessions with expiry\n- `teams` - Team groups with identifier prefix (e.g., \"ENG\")\n- `team_members` - Junction table for team membership\n- `labels` - Issue tags with color codes\n- `projects` - Cross-team initiatives with status/dates\n- `cycles` - Time-boxed sprints per team\n- `issues` - Core work items with all metadata\n- `issue_labels` - Junction for issue-label relationships\n- `comments` - Issue discussions\n- `activity` - Audit log of all issue changes\n- `notifications` - User notifications\n- `project_milestones` - Project tracking\n- `project_activity` - Project change history\n\n**Seed data file:** `seed-db.ts`\n- Creates 1 workspace: \"Acme Corp\"\n- Creates 3 members: Alice Johnson (admin), Bob Smith, Carol Davis\n- Creates 2 teams: Engineering (ENG), Design (DES)\n- Creates 4 labels: Bug, Feature, Improvement, Documentation\n- Creates 1 project: \"V2 Launch\" with 2 milestones\n- Creates 1 active cycle: \"Sprint 12\"\n- Creates 11 seed issues across teams with various statuses/priorities\n- Creates 3 notifications for Alice\n\n**Default test credentials:**\n- Email: `alice@acme.com`, `bob@acme.com`, `carol@acme.com`\n- Password: `password123` (for all)\n\n---\n\n### 3. TESTS DOCUMENTATION\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (2685 lines)\n\n**Test coverage includes:**\n\n1. **Login Page** (10 tests)\n   - Form rendering, successful login, credential validation\n   - Email/password validation, Enter key submission\n   - Authenticated user redirect\n\n2. **Sign Up Page** (9 tests)\n   - Form rendering, account creation\n   - Email uniqueness, field validation\n   - Password minimum length (8 chars)\n\n3. **Navigation Sidebar** (45+ tests)\n   - Workspace header navigation\n   - Main navigation (My Issues, Inbox with badge)\n   - Team sections (collapsible, Issues/Cycles/Projects/Views links)\n   - Workspace links (All Projects, All Teams, Members, Labels, Settings)\n   - Active link highlighting\n   - Sidebar collapse/expand to icon-only mode\n   - Keyboard shortcuts (C, G+I, G+N)\n\n4. **My Issues Page** (30+ tests)\n   - Issues grouped by status (Backlog, Todo, In Progress, In Review, Done, Cancelled)\n   - Collapsible groups\n   - Empty state handling\n   - Filter toolbar (Status, Priority, Label with multi-select)\n   - Issue rows with priority icon, identifier, title, status, labels, assignee avatar, due date, project\n\n5. **Inbox Page** (tests defined)\n   - Notification list display\n   - Unread count badge\n   - Mark as read / archive functionality\n\n6. **Additional pages tested:**\n   - Team Issues\n   - Issue Detail\n   - Projects\n   - Cycles\n   - Members/Teams/Labels settings\n\n---\n\n### 4. EXISTING TEST FILES\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`\n\n**Files:**\n- `login.spec.ts` - 8206 bytes (login tests)\n- `signup.spec.ts` - 8477 bytes (signup tests)\n- `sidebar.spec.ts` - 14881 bytes (comprehensive sidebar tests)\n- `sidebar-navigation.spec.ts` - 4166 bytes\n- `sidebar-collapse.spec.ts` - 8005 bytes\n- `keyboard-shortcuts.spec.ts` - 7384 bytes\n\n---\n\n### 5. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIGURATION\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- testDir: './tests'\n- timeout: 60000ms per test\n- expect timeout: 10000ms\n- fullyParallel: true\n- forbidOnly: true\n- retries: 0\n- reporters: \n  - Replay.io (upload: false)\n  - JSON output: test-results/results.json\n  - HTML report: open: never\n- baseURL: http://localhost:8888\n- actionTimeout: 15000ms\n- Device: Replay Chromium with special recording capabilities\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. MY ISSUES PAGE STRUCTURE\n\n**Page file:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/MyIssues.tsx`\n\n**Components:**\n- `MyIssuesList.tsx` - Renders issues grouped by status\n- `IssueRow.tsx` - Individual issue display\n- `FiltersToolbar.tsx` - Status/Priority/Label filters\n\n**Page logic:**\n1. Fetches user's issues via `fetchMyIssues()` thunk\n2. Fetches labels via `fetchLabels()` thunk\n3. Provides filters: selectedStatuses, selectedPriorities, selectedLabels\n4. Uses useMemo to filter issues client-side\n5. Groups issues by status using STATUS_ORDER\n\n**Status order:** backlog → todo → in_progress → in_review → done → cancelled\n\n**Issue Row displays:**\n- Priority icon (Urgent/High/Medium/Low/None)\n- Issue identifier (e.g., ENG-42)\n- Title (clickable, navigates to /issue/<id>)\n- Status icon (with dropdown to change status)\n- Labels (colored badges)\n- Project name\n- Due date (formatted as \"Mar 20\")\n- Assignee avatar (initials if no avatar)\n\n**Status icons:**\n- Backlog: dotted circle (gray)\n- Todo: circle (gray)\n- In Progress: half circle (yellow)\n- In Review: three-quarter circle (blue)\n- Done: check circle (green)\n- Cancelled: x-circle (red)\n\n**Priority icons:**\n- Urgent: alert-triangle (red)\n- High: arrow-up (orange)\n- Medium: minus (yellow)\n- Low: arrow-down (blue)\n- No Priority: dots-horizontal (gray)\n\n---\n\n### 7. NETLIFY API ENDPOINTS (ISSUES-RELATED)\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Read endpoints:**\n\n1. **`my-issues.ts`** - GET /api/my-issues\n   - Auth: Bearer token\n   - Returns: Issues assigned to current user\n   - Enriches with team identifier, project name, labels, assignee info\n   - SQL joins: teams, projects, members, issue_labels, labels\n\n2. **`team-issues.ts`** - GET /api/team-issues?teamId=<id>\n   - Auth: Bearer token\n   - Query param: teamId (required)\n   - Returns: All team issues + team members + projects + cycles\n   - Same enrichment as my-issues\n\n3. **`issue-detail.ts`** - GET /api/issue-detail?issueId=<id>\n   - Auth: Bearer token\n   - Query param: issueId (required)\n   - Returns: Full issue + sub-issues + activity + comments + team members + projects + cycles + all labels\n\n**Write endpoints:**\n\n4. **`create-issue.ts`** - POST /api/create-issue\n   - Body: teamId, title, description, status, priority, assigneeId, labelIds[], projectId, cycleId, dueDate, parentId\n   - Validates: teamId and title required\n   - Generates next issue number per team\n   - Creates activity entry \"created this issue\"\n   - Notifies assignee if assigned to different user\n   - Returns: Created issue object\n\n5. **`update-issue-status.ts`** - PUT /api/update-issue-status\n   - Body: issueId, status\n   - Validates: issueId, status required, status in valid list\n   - Valid statuses: backlog, todo, in_progress, in_review, done, cancelled\n   - Updates updated_at timestamp\n   - Returns: {id, status}\n\n6. **`update-issue.ts`** - PUT /api/update-issue\n   - Body: issueId, field, value, labelIds[] (optional)\n   - Supports fields: title, description, status, priority, assigneeId, projectId, cycleId, dueDate, labels\n   - Creates activity entry with human-readable action message\n   - Notifies assignee if assigned\n   - Returns: Updated issue + activity entry\n\n7. **`bulk-update-issues.ts`** - PUT /api/bulk-update-issues\n   - Body: issueIds[], status?, priority?, assigneeId?, labelId?, teamId\n   - Bulk updates and refetches team issues\n\n**Helper:**\n\n8. **`db.ts`** - Database connection\n   - Uses Neon serverless with DATABASE_URL env var\n   - Export: getSql() function\n\n---\n\n### 8. REDUX STORE & SLICES\n\n**Store file:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/store.ts`\n\n**Redux slices (13 total):**\n\n1. **`authSlice.ts`** - Auth state\n   - State: user (id, name, email), token, loading, error\n   - Thunks: login(), signup(), fetchCurrentUser()\n   - Actions: logout(), clearError()\n   - Token persisted to localStorage\n\n2. **`issuesSlice.ts`** - My Issues\n   - State: myIssues[], loading, error\n   - Thunk: fetchMyIssues(), createIssue(), updateIssueStatus()\n   - Issue interface: id, title, description, status, priority, identifier, number, dueDate, createdAt, updatedAt, teamId, teamName, assigneeId, assigneeName, assigneeEmail, projectId, projectName, cycleId, parentId, labels[]\n\n3. **`issueDetailSlice.ts`** - Issue detail page\n   - State: issue, subIssues[], activity[], comments[], members[], projects[], cycles[], allLabels[], loading, error\n   - Thunks: fetchIssueDetail(), updateIssueField(), addComment()\n   - Action: clearIssueDetail()\n   - SubIssue, ActivityEntry, Comment, TeamMember, TeamProject, TeamCycle interfaces\n\n4. **`teamIssuesSlice.ts`** - Team issues list\n   - State: items[], members[], projects[], cycles[], loading, error, selectedIds[], groupBy, sortBy\n   - Thunks: fetchTeamIssues(), bulkUpdateIssues()\n   - Actions: toggleIssueSelection(), selectGroupIssues(), clearSelection(), setGroupBy(), setSortBy()\n   - GroupBy options: status, priority, assignee, project, label, none\n   - SortBy options: priority, created, updated, status\n\n5. **`notificationsSlice.ts`** - Notifications\n   - State: unreadCount, items[], loading\n   - Thunks: fetchUnreadCount(), fetchNotifications(), markNotificationRead(), archiveNotification()\n   - Actions: decrementUnreadCount(), setUnreadCount()\n   - Notification types: assignment, update, mention\n\n6. **`labelsSlice.ts`** - Labels\n7. **`teamsSlice.ts`** - Teams management\n8. **`workspaceSlice.ts`** - Workspace\n9. **`cyclesSlice.ts`** - Cycles\n10. **`projectsSlice.ts`** - Projects\n11. **`projectDetailSlice.ts`** - Project detail\n12. **`membersSlice.ts`** - Members\n13. **`uiSlice.ts`** - UI state (modals, etc.)\n\n---\n\n### 9. KEY FILES FOR \"MY ISSUES\"\n\n**Frontend:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/MyIssues.tsx` - Main page component\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/MyIssuesList.tsx` - List with status grouping\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueRow.tsx` - Issue row with status dropdown\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/FiltersToolbar.tsx` - Filter controls\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/issuesSlice.ts` - Redux slice\n\n**Backend:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/my-issues.ts` - Fetch endpoint\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue-status.ts` - Status update\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue.ts` - Field updates\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/create-issue.ts` - Issue creation\n\n---\n\n### 10. KEY COMPONENTS OVERVIEW\n\n**Pages (11 total):**\n- Login, SignUp, MyIssues, Inbox\n- TeamIssues, IssueDetail, ActiveCycle\n- Projects, ProjectDetail\n- Members, Teams, Labels, Settings\n\n**Components (43 total):**\n- Forms: LoginForm, SignUpForm, CreateIssueForm, CreateIssueModal\n- Lists: MyIssuesList, IssueRow, NotificationList, NotificationRow\n- Sidebar: Sidebar, SidebarCollapse, KeyboardShortcuts\n- Filters: FiltersToolbar, TeamFilters, ProjectFilters\n- Other: IssueHeader, IssueDescription, IssueSidebar, ActivityComments, SubIssues, BulkActions, GroupBySort, TeamIssuesList\n- Team/Project/Cycle/Label/Member management components\n\n---\n\n### 11. CORE FEATURES\n\n**Authentication:**\n- Email/password login and signup\n- Session tokens with expiry\n- localStorage persistence\n- Password hashing with pbkdf2\n\n**Issues Management:**\n- Create, read, update issues\n- Status changes (6 statuses)\n- Priority levels (5 levels)\n- Labels, projects, cycles assignment\n- Sub-issues support\n- Due dates\n- Comments and activity tracking\n\n**Navigation:**\n- Sidebar with collapsible sections\n- Keyboard shortcuts (C, G+I, G+N)\n- Breadcrumbs/active link indicators\n\n**Filtering & Grouping:**\n- By status, priority, assignee, project, label\n- Multi-select filters\n- Group by status/priority/assignee/project/label/none\n- Sort by priority/created/updated/status\n\n**Notifications:**\n- Unread count badge\n- Mark as read/archived\n- Types: assignment, update, mention\n\n---\n\n### 12. IMPORTANT CONSTANTS & CONFIGURATIONS\n\n**Status values:** backlog, todo, in_progress, in_review, done, cancelled\n\n**Priority values:** urgent, high, medium, low, none\n\n**Valid team identifier format:** 2-5 uppercase characters (e.g., \"ENG\", \"DES\")\n\n**Password requirements:**\n- Minimum 8 characters (per tests.md)\n- Hashed with pbkdf2Sync (10000 iterations, sha512)\n\n**Session expiry:** Stored in database with expires_at timestamp, validated on API calls\n\n**Notification types:** assigned, comment, mention (based on type field)\n\n---\n\nThis comprehensive exploration provides a complete understanding of the LinearClone architecture, including the database design, API endpoints, Redux state management, React components, and the extensive test specifications that define expected behavior across the entire application."},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: a97732d38efb2e98e (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 83291\ntool_uses: 41\nduration_ms: 72673</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"10e19085-a83f-4be1-bcf4-a4ad823ec258","uuid":"2f73353a-9d4b-40bc-9324-542423a0745f","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Explore the linear-clone app in /repo/apps/. I need to understand:\n1. The app directory structure (list files in apps/linear-clone or similar)\n2. The docs/tests.md file for test specs\n3. The seed data/schema for the database\n4. The existing test files if any\n5. The playwright config\n6. The pages and components related to \"My Issues\" page\n7. The Netlify functions (API endpoints) related to issues\n8. The Redux store/slices related to issues\n\nBe very thorough - read all relevant source files.","agentId":"a97732d38efb2e98e","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information needed. Let me create a comprehensive summary report:\n\n## LinearClone App Comprehensive Exploration Report\n\nI've conducted a thorough exploration of the LinearClone app located at `/repo/apps/LinearClone/`. Here's a detailed breakdown:\n\n---\n\n### 1. APP DIRECTORY STRUCTURE\n\n**Main directories:**\n- `/src` - Frontend React application (71 TypeScript/TSX files)\n- `/netlify/functions` - Backend API endpoints (26 functions)\n- `/scripts` - Database schema, seeding, and utility scripts\n- `/tests` - Playwright test files (6 test specs)\n- `/docs` - Documentation including tests.md (2685 lines)\n- `/public` - Static assets\n- `netlify.toml` - Netlify configuration\n- `playwright.config.ts` - Playwright test configuration\n- `vite.config.ts` - Vite bundler configuration\n- `tsconfig.*.json` - TypeScript configurations\n\n**Key dependencies:**\n- React 19.2.0, React Router 7.6.1\n- Redux Toolkit 2.11.2, React-Redux 9.2.0\n- Neon Database (serverless PostgreSQL)\n- Netlify Functions for API\n- Playwright for E2E testing with Replay.io integration\n\n---\n\n### 2. DATABASE SCHEMA & SEED DATA\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/`\n\n**Schema file:** `schema.ts`\n- Defines 12 main tables with proper relationships and indexes\n\n**Tables:**\n- `workspaces` - Top-level container, one per app\n- `members` - Users with bcrypt password hashing (pbkdf2)\n- `sessions` - JWT-like token-based sessions with expiry\n- `teams` - Team groups with identifier prefix (e.g., \"ENG\")\n- `team_members` - Junction table for team membership\n- `labels` - Issue tags with color codes\n- `projects` - Cross-team initiatives with status/dates\n- `cycles` - Time-boxed sprints per team\n- `issues` - Core work items with all metadata\n- `issue_labels` - Junction for issue-label relationships\n- `comments` - Issue discussions\n- `activity` - Audit log of all issue changes\n- `notifications` - User notifications\n- `project_milestones` - Project tracking\n- `project_activity` - Project change history\n\n**Seed data file:** `seed-db.ts`\n- Creates 1 workspace: \"Acme Corp\"\n- Creates 3 members: Alice Johnson (admin), Bob Smith, Carol Davis\n- Creates 2 teams: Engineering (ENG), Design (DES)\n- Creates 4 labels: Bug, Feature, Improvement, Documentation\n- Creates 1 project: \"V2 Launch\" with 2 milestones\n- Creates 1 active cycle: \"Sprint 12\"\n- Creates 11 seed issues across teams with various statuses/priorities\n- Creates 3 notifications for Alice\n\n**Default test credentials:**\n- Email: `alice@acme.com`, `bob@acme.com`, `carol@acme.com`\n- Password: `password123` (for all)\n\n---\n\n### 3. TESTS DOCUMENTATION\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md` (2685 lines)\n\n**Test coverage includes:**\n\n1. **Login Page** (10 tests)\n   - Form rendering, successful login, credential validation\n   - Email/password validation, Enter key submission\n   - Authenticated user redirect\n\n2. **Sign Up Page** (9 tests)\n   - Form rendering, account creation\n   - Email uniqueness, field validation\n   - Password minimum length (8 chars)\n\n3. **Navigation Sidebar** (45+ tests)\n   - Workspace header navigation\n   - Main navigation (My Issues, Inbox with badge)\n   - Team sections (collapsible, Issues/Cycles/Projects/Views links)\n   - Workspace links (All Projects, All Teams, Members, Labels, Settings)\n   - Active link highlighting\n   - Sidebar collapse/expand to icon-only mode\n   - Keyboard shortcuts (C, G+I, G+N)\n\n4. **My Issues Page** (30+ tests)\n   - Issues grouped by status (Backlog, Todo, In Progress, In Review, Done, Cancelled)\n   - Collapsible groups\n   - Empty state handling\n   - Filter toolbar (Status, Priority, Label with multi-select)\n   - Issue rows with priority icon, identifier, title, status, labels, assignee avatar, due date, project\n\n5. **Inbox Page** (tests defined)\n   - Notification list display\n   - Unread count badge\n   - Mark as read / archive functionality\n\n6. **Additional pages tested:**\n   - Team Issues\n   - Issue Detail\n   - Projects\n   - Cycles\n   - Members/Teams/Labels settings\n\n---\n\n### 4. EXISTING TEST FILES\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/`\n\n**Files:**\n- `login.spec.ts` - 8206 bytes (login tests)\n- `signup.spec.ts` - 8477 bytes (signup tests)\n- `sidebar.spec.ts` - 14881 bytes (comprehensive sidebar tests)\n- `sidebar-navigation.spec.ts` - 4166 bytes\n- `sidebar-collapse.spec.ts` - 8005 bytes\n- `keyboard-shortcuts.spec.ts` - 7384 bytes\n\n---\n\n### 5. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIGURATION\n\n**File:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n- testDir: './tests'\n- timeout: 60000ms per test\n- expect timeout: 10000ms\n- fullyParallel: true\n- forbidOnly: true\n- retries: 0\n- reporters: \n  - Replay.io (upload: false)\n  - JSON output: test-results/results.json\n  - HTML report: open: never\n- baseURL: http://localhost:8888\n- actionTimeout: 15000ms\n- Device: Replay Chromium with special recording capabilities\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. MY ISSUES PAGE STRUCTURE\n\n**Page file:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/MyIssues.tsx`\n\n**Components:**\n- `MyIssuesList.tsx` - Renders issues grouped by status\n- `IssueRow.tsx` - Individual issue display\n- `FiltersToolbar.tsx` - Status/Priority/Label filters\n\n**Page logic:**\n1. Fetches user's issues via `fetchMyIssues()` thunk\n2. Fetches labels via `fetchLabels()` thunk\n3. Provides filters: selectedStatuses, selectedPriorities, selectedLabels\n4. Uses useMemo to filter issues client-side\n5. Groups issues by status using STATUS_ORDER\n\n**Status order:** backlog → todo → in_progress → in_review → done → cancelled\n\n**Issue Row displays:**\n- Priority icon (Urgent/High/Medium/Low/None)\n- Issue identifier (e.g., ENG-42)\n- Title (clickable, navigates to /issue/<id>)\n- Status icon (with dropdown to change status)\n- Labels (colored badges)\n- Project name\n- Due date (formatted as \"Mar 20\")\n- Assignee avatar (initials if no avatar)\n\n**Status icons:**\n- Backlog: dotted circle (gray)\n- Todo: circle (gray)\n- In Progress: half circle (yellow)\n- In Review: three-quarter circle (blue)\n- Done: check circle (green)\n- Cancelled: x-circle (red)\n\n**Priority icons:**\n- Urgent: alert-triangle (red)\n- High: arrow-up (orange)\n- Medium: minus (yellow)\n- Low: arrow-down (blue)\n- No Priority: dots-horizontal (gray)\n\n---\n\n### 7. NETLIFY API ENDPOINTS (ISSUES-RELATED)\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Read endpoints:**\n\n1. **`my-issues.ts`** - GET /api/my-issues\n   - Auth: Bearer token\n   - Returns: Issues assigned to current user\n   - Enriches with team identifier, project name, labels, assignee info\n   - SQL joins: teams, projects, members, issue_labels, labels\n\n2. **`team-issues.ts`** - GET /api/team-issues?teamId=<id>\n   - Auth: Bearer token\n   - Query param: teamId (required)\n   - Returns: All team issues + team members + projects + cycles\n   - Same enrichment as my-issues\n\n3. **`issue-detail.ts`** - GET /api/issue-detail?issueId=<id>\n   - Auth: Bearer token\n   - Query param: issueId (required)\n   - Returns: Full issue + sub-issues + activity + comments + team members + projects + cycles + all labels\n\n**Write endpoints:**\n\n4. **`create-issue.ts`** - POST /api/create-issue\n   - Body: teamId, title, description, status, priority, assigneeId, labelIds[], projectId, cycleId, dueDate, parentId\n   - Validates: teamId and title required\n   - Generates next issue number per team\n   - Creates activity entry \"created this issue\"\n   - Notifies assignee if assigned to different user\n   - Returns: Created issue object\n\n5. **`update-issue-status.ts`** - PUT /api/update-issue-status\n   - Body: issueId, status\n   - Validates: issueId, status required, status in valid list\n   - Valid statuses: backlog, todo, in_progress, in_review, done, cancelled\n   - Updates updated_at timestamp\n   - Returns: {id, status}\n\n6. **`update-issue.ts`** - PUT /api/update-issue\n   - Body: issueId, field, value, labelIds[] (optional)\n   - Supports fields: title, description, status, priority, assigneeId, projectId, cycleId, dueDate, labels\n   - Creates activity entry with human-readable action message\n   - Notifies assignee if assigned\n   - Returns: Updated issue + activity entry\n\n7. **`bulk-update-issues.ts`** - PUT /api/bulk-update-issues\n   - Body: issueIds[], status?, priority?, assigneeId?, labelId?, teamId\n   - Bulk updates and refetches team issues\n\n**Helper:**\n\n8. **`db.ts`** - Database connection\n   - Uses Neon serverless with DATABASE_URL env var\n   - Export: getSql() function\n\n---\n\n### 8. REDUX STORE & SLICES\n\n**Store file:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/store.ts`\n\n**Redux slices (13 total):**\n\n1. **`authSlice.ts`** - Auth state\n   - State: user (id, name, email), token, loading, error\n   - Thunks: login(), signup(), fetchCurrentUser()\n   - Actions: logout(), clearError()\n   - Token persisted to localStorage\n\n2. **`issuesSlice.ts`** - My Issues\n   - State: myIssues[], loading, error\n   - Thunk: fetchMyIssues(), createIssue(), updateIssueStatus()\n   - Issue interface: id, title, description, status, priority, identifier, number, dueDate, createdAt, updatedAt, teamId, teamName, assigneeId, assigneeName, assigneeEmail, projectId, projectName, cycleId, parentId, labels[]\n\n3. **`issueDetailSlice.ts`** - Issue detail page\n   - State: issue, subIssues[], activity[], comments[], members[], projects[], cycles[], allLabels[], loading, error\n   - Thunks: fetchIssueDetail(), updateIssueField(), addComment()\n   - Action: clearIssueDetail()\n   - SubIssue, ActivityEntry, Comment, TeamMember, TeamProject, TeamCycle interfaces\n\n4. **`teamIssuesSlice.ts`** - Team issues list\n   - State: items[], members[], projects[], cycles[], loading, error, selectedIds[], groupBy, sortBy\n   - Thunks: fetchTeamIssues(), bulkUpdateIssues()\n   - Actions: toggleIssueSelection(), selectGroupIssues(), clearSelection(), setGroupBy(), setSortBy()\n   - GroupBy options: status, priority, assignee, project, label, none\n   - SortBy options: priority, created, updated, status\n\n5. **`notificationsSlice.ts`** - Notifications\n   - State: unreadCount, items[], loading\n   - Thunks: fetchUnreadCount(), fetchNotifications(), markNotificationRead(), archiveNotification()\n   - Actions: decrementUnreadCount(), setUnreadCount()\n   - Notification types: assignment, update, mention\n\n6. **`labelsSlice.ts`** - Labels\n7. **`teamsSlice.ts`** - Teams management\n8. **`workspaceSlice.ts`** - Workspace\n9. **`cyclesSlice.ts`** - Cycles\n10. **`projectsSlice.ts`** - Projects\n11. **`projectDetailSlice.ts`** - Project detail\n12. **`membersSlice.ts`** - Members\n13. **`uiSlice.ts`** - UI state (modals, etc.)\n\n---\n\n### 9. KEY FILES FOR \"MY ISSUES\"\n\n**Frontend:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/MyIssues.tsx` - Main page component\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/MyIssuesList.tsx` - List with status grouping\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/IssueRow.tsx` - Issue row with status dropdown\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/FiltersToolbar.tsx` - Filter controls\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/issuesSlice.ts` - Redux slice\n\n**Backend:**\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/my-issues.ts` - Fetch endpoint\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue-status.ts` - Status update\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/update-issue.ts` - Field updates\n- `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/create-issue.ts` - Issue creation\n\n---\n\n### 10. KEY COMPONENTS OVERVIEW\n\n**Pages (11 total):**\n- Login, SignUp, MyIssues, Inbox\n- TeamIssues, IssueDetail, ActiveCycle\n- Projects, ProjectDetail\n- Members, Teams, Labels, Settings\n\n**Components (43 total):**\n- Forms: LoginForm, SignUpForm, CreateIssueForm, CreateIssueModal\n- Lists: MyIssuesList, IssueRow, NotificationList, NotificationRow\n- Sidebar: Sidebar, SidebarCollapse, KeyboardShortcuts\n- Filters: FiltersToolbar, TeamFilters, ProjectFilters\n- Other: IssueHeader, IssueDescription, IssueSidebar, ActivityComments, SubIssues, BulkActions, GroupBySort, TeamIssuesList\n- Team/Project/Cycle/Label/Member management components\n\n---\n\n### 11. CORE FEATURES\n\n**Authentication:**\n- Email/password login and signup\n- Session tokens with expiry\n- localStorage persistence\n- Password hashing with pbkdf2\n\n**Issues Management:**\n- Create, read, update issues\n- Status changes (6 statuses)\n- Priority levels (5 levels)\n- Labels, projects, cycles assignment\n- Sub-issues support\n- Due dates\n- Comments and activity tracking\n\n**Navigation:**\n- Sidebar with collapsible sections\n- Keyboard shortcuts (C, G+I, G+N)\n- Breadcrumbs/active link indicators\n\n**Filtering & Grouping:**\n- By status, priority, assignee, project, label\n- Multi-select filters\n- Group by status/priority/assignee/project/label/none\n- Sort by priority/created/updated/status\n\n**Notifications:**\n- Unread count badge\n- Mark as read/archived\n- Types: assignment, update, mention\n\n---\n\n### 12. IMPORTANT CONSTANTS & CONFIGURATIONS\n\n**Status values:** backlog, todo, in_progress, in_review, done, cancelled\n\n**Priority values:** urgent, high, medium, low, none\n\n**Valid team identifier format:** 2-5 uppercase characters (e.g., \"ENG\", \"DES\")\n\n**Password requirements:**\n- Minimum 8 characters (per tests.md)\n- Hashed with pbkdf2Sync (10000 iterations, sha512)\n\n**Session expiry:** Stored in database with expires_at timestamp, validated on API calls\n\n**Notification types:** assigned, comment, mention (based on type field)\n\n---\n\nThis comprehensive exploration provides a complete understanding of the LinearClone architecture, including the database design, API endpoints, Redux state management, React components, and the extensive test specifications that define expected behavior across the entire application."}],"totalDurationMs":72673,"totalTokens":83291,"totalToolUseCount":41,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11170,"cache_read_input_tokens":68012,"output_tokens":4105,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":11170},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
